Package: simcow
Type: Package
Title: Similarity-based Cohort Weighting
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Max Behrens
Maintainer: Max Behrens <max.behrens@uniklinik-freiburg.de>
Description: This R package provides functions to generate cohort weights for datasets with multiple cohorts. The weights let a prediction model for a target cohort borrow observations from external cohorts in proportion to their similarity to the target cohort.
